{"id": "restricted-source-gift-cases", "title": "Gifts and conflicts at City Hall: 13 admitted cases, 2022–2026", "seconds": 135.1, "voice": "elevenlabs:exurTFaGNF2gnRcPNH8I", "narrator": "Phil", "tempo": 1.2, "made": "2026-11-27", "key": "61d8ffb9f7035e3e", "words": 411, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[0]"], "text": "San Francisco bars City staff from taking gifts from anyone doing business with their own department.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.53, "shot": "b0", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "cityhall", "label": "A restricted source", "sub": "anyone doing business with your own department"}, "wt": [0.11, 0.18, 0.68, 1.07, 1.42, 1.89, 2.05, 2.4, 2.79, 3.06, 3.46, 3.77, 4.12, 4.36, 4.52, 4.72]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[1]", "oneLine"], "text": "Since May 2022, how many officials and employees have admitted breaking it, or a related conflict rule?", "t0": 5.65, "t1": 12.08, "shot": "b1", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "May 2022 to July 2026", "sub": "gift and conflict cases, admitted"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.24, 0.41, 0.56, 1.15, 1.28, 1.43, 1.8, 1.9, 2.35, 2.48, 2.76, 3.1, 3.3, 3.42, 3.5, 3.9, 4.31]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "count", "ref": ["story[1]"], "text": "13.", "t0": 12.08, "t1": 14.37, "shot": "b2", "visual": {"type": "count", "value": "13", "label": "officials and employees", "sub": "each a signed Ethics Commission settlement"}, "emph": ["13"], "wt": [0.04]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["defense[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[9]"], "text": "Each signed a settlement with the Ethics Commission, accepting responsibility.", "t0": 14.89, "t1": 18.46, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Admitted", "sub": "$153,561 in penalties, none a criminal conviction"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.29, 0.72, 0.8, 1.24, 1.31, 1.4, 1.73, 2.26, 2.68]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["defense[0]", "notEstablished[1]", "established[9]"], "text": "Together they paid 153,561 dollars.", "t0": 18.58, "t1": 22.33, "shot": "b3", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "gavel", "label": "Admitted", "sub": "$153,561 in penalties, none a criminal conviction"}, "emph": ["153,561"], "wt": [0.0, 0.44, 0.64, 0.85, 1.02, 1.27, 1.71, 2.15, 2.48, 2.67, 3.19]}, {"scene": "chiem", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["story[2]", "suspicious[0]"], "text": "The biggest penalty went to Charlie Chiem, a computer support worker at the transit agency, SFMTA.", "t0": 22.55, "t1": 27.45, "shot": "b4", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Charlie Chiem", "kicker": "The biggest penalty", "sub": "computer support, SFMTA"}, "wt": [0.01, 0.05, 0.27, 0.65, 0.8, 0.93, 1.27, 1.72, 1.79, 2.13, 2.46, 2.76, 2.91, 3.0, 3.35, 3.96]}, {"scene": "chiem", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[0]"], "text": "On City time, he sat through more than 600 webinars for gift cards.", "t0": 27.57, "t1": 30.97, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Webinars and ball games", "kicker": "The biggest penalty", "sub": "600 webinars, at least 14 pro sports events"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.12, 0.38, 0.71, 0.83, 0.96, 1.16, 1.29, 1.48, 1.76, 2.05, 2.58, 2.77, 2.99]}, {"scene": "chiem", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[0].what", "established[0]"], "text": "He went to at least 14 pro sports games.", "t0": 31.09, "t1": 33.49, "shot": "b5", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "Webinars and ball games", "kicker": "The biggest penalty", "sub": "600 webinars, at least 14 pro sports events"}, "emph": ["14"], "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.38, 0.51, 0.63, 0.85, 1.33, 1.58, 1.93]}, {"scene": "chiem", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["suspicious[0].why"], "text": "The hosts were tech companies seeking SFMTA’s business.", "t0": 33.61, "t1": 36.83, "shot": "b6", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "seeking to do business with SFMTA"}, "wt": [0.15, 0.35, 0.66, 0.8, 1.0, 1.34, 1.78, 2.54]}, {"scene": "chiem", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[0]"], "text": "His penalty? 42,611 dollars. He had no say over purchasing.", "t0": 36.95, "t1": 41.86, "shot": "b7", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$42,611", "label": "Chiem’s penalty, March 13, 2026", "sub": "he had no say over purchasing"}, "emph": ["42,611"], "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.6, 1.29, 1.8, 1.92, 2.16, 2.56, 3.14, 3.4, 3.56, 3.78, 4.07, 4.28]}, {"scene": "lab", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "At the Public Health Lab, director Godfred Masinde had supplier Abbott buy 19 staff a holiday lunch.", "t0": 42.08, "t1": 47.39, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A steakhouse lunch", "kicker": "Public Health Lab", "sub": "Godfred Masinde, December 21, 2023, 19 City employees", "chip": "penalty $2,500"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.06, 0.2, 0.46, 0.7, 1.0, 1.38, 1.81, 2.3, 2.54, 2.96, 3.4, 3.54, 3.97, 4.43, 4.54, 4.88]}, {"scene": "lab", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[1]", "suspicious[1].why"], "text": "Penalty: 2,500 dollars.", "t0": 47.51, "t1": 49.51, "shot": "b8", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "money", "label": "A steakhouse lunch", "kicker": "Public Health Lab", "sub": "Godfred Masinde, December 21, 2023, 19 City employees", "chip": "penalty $2,500"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.55, 0.64, 1.05, 1.29, 1.52]}, {"scene": "ignite", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "links[2]"], "text": "Commissioner Sophia Andary voted for a 500,000 dollar no-bid grant to Ignite.", "t0": 49.73, "t1": 54.6, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["December 13, 2023", "$500,000"], "b": ["March 27, 2024", "$700,000"], "mid": "no-bid grant to Ignite"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.47, 0.95, 1.59, 1.88, 2.03, 2.17, 2.36, 2.58, 2.98, 3.36, 3.79, 4.13, 4.32]}, {"scene": "ignite", "kind": "versus", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "links[2]"], "text": "Then to raise it to 700,000.", "t0": 54.72, "t1": 56.51, "shot": "b9", "visual": {"type": "versus", "a": ["December 13, 2023", "$500,000"], "b": ["March 27, 2024", "$700,000"], "mid": "no-bid grant to Ignite"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.27, 0.46, 0.57, 0.74, 0.94, 1.23]}, {"scene": "ignite", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].what", "established[2]"], "text": "A month later, Ignite paid her for leading a session. How much?", "t0": 56.63, "t1": 59.57, "shot": "b10", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "April 29, 2024", "kicker": "Then Ignite paid her", "sub": "an honorarium"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.1, 0.31, 0.72, 1.04, 1.23, 1.37, 1.49, 1.7, 1.78, 2.27, 2.53]}, {"scene": "ignite", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[2]", "links[3]"], "text": "1,000 dollars.", "t0": 59.57, "t1": 60.91, "shot": "b11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,000", "label": "honorarium from Ignite"}, "emph": ["1,000"], "wt": [0.04, 0.43, 0.78]}, {"scene": "ignite", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[2].why"], "text": "The invitation to speak came two days before her second vote.", "t0": 61.43, "t1": 64.59, "shot": "b12", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "Two days", "kicker": "The invitation", "sub": "before the second vote"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.2, 0.7, 0.81, 1.21, 1.51, 1.68, 1.99, 2.31, 2.45, 2.75]}, {"scene": "raphael", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "Environment director Deborah Raphael took gifts from Recology, the City’s trash hauler,", "t0": 64.81, "t1": 68.75, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Deborah Raphael", "kicker": "Environment director", "sub": "gifts from Recology and Friends of SF Environment", "chip": "penalty $4,000"}, "wt": [0.31, 0.44, 0.84, 1.19, 1.69, 1.85, 2.17, 2.38, 3.01, 3.1, 3.37, 3.63]}, {"scene": "raphael", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[3]"], "text": "and from Friends of SF Environment.", "t0": 68.75, "t1": 70.71, "shot": "b13", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Deborah Raphael", "kicker": "Environment director", "sub": "gifts from Recology and Friends of SF Environment", "chip": "penalty $4,000"}, "wt": [0.04, 0.23, 0.43, 0.75, 0.92, 1.09, 1.17]}, {"scene": "raphael", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "In 2018, the same year it gave her a gift, she signed a grant naming that nonprofit.", "t0": 70.83, "t1": 75.16, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "September 1, 2018", "kicker": "Environment director", "sub": "she signs a grant naming Friends of SF Environment", "chip": "penalty $4,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.3, 0.87, 0.96, 1.14, 1.29, 1.42, 1.62, 1.75, 1.84, 2.47, 2.56, 2.82, 2.91, 3.23, 3.54, 3.71]}, {"scene": "raphael", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[3].what", "suspicious[3].why"], "text": "Penalty: 4,000 dollars.", "t0": 75.28, "t1": 77.19, "shot": "b14", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "calendar", "label": "September 1, 2018", "kicker": "Environment director", "sub": "she signs a grant naming Friends of SF Environment", "chip": "penalty $4,000"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.72, 1.01, 1.41]}, {"scene": "mumby", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "links[5]"], "text": "Arts Commission grants director Barbara Mumby arranged a grant for a friend.", "t0": 77.41, "t1": 80.87, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Barbara Mumby", "kicker": "Arts Commission grants director", "sub": "a grant for a friend, a group trip to Hawaii"}, "wt": [0.11, 0.16, 0.51, 0.84, 1.17, 1.52, 1.91, 2.33, 2.44, 2.72, 2.97, 3.09]}, {"scene": "mumby", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "links[5]"], "text": "About 14,000 dollars paid for a Hawaii trip.", "t0": 80.99, "t1": 83.52, "shot": "b15", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "contract", "label": "Barbara Mumby", "kicker": "Arts Commission grants director", "sub": "a grant for a friend, a group trip to Hawaii"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.55, 0.9, 1.3, 1.55, 1.68, 1.77, 2.17]}, {"scene": "mumby", "kind": "scene", "ref": ["suspicious[4].what", "links[6]"], "text": "Then the friend wrote Mumby a check. For how much?", "t0": 83.64, "t1": 86.09, "shot": "b16", "visual": {"type": "scene", "art": "question", "label": "June 25, 2019", "kicker": "Then a check"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.27, 0.48, 0.69, 0.94, 1.03, 1.41, 1.74, 1.91]}, {"scene": "mumby", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4]", "established[4]"], "text": "3,500 dollars.", "t0": 86.09, "t1": 87.68, "shot": "b17", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$3,500", "label": "deposited June 25, 2019"}, "emph": ["3,500"], "wt": [0.04, 0.3, 0.65, 0.89, 1.11]}, {"scene": "mumby", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[4].why", "established[4]"], "text": "Grant money came back to the official who arranged it. She also misled investigators. Penalty: 20,000 dollars.", "t0": 88.2, "t1": 94.55, "shot": "b18", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$20,000", "label": "Mumby’s penalty, May 13, 2022", "sub": "she also gave investigators false information"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.25, 0.52, 0.79, 1.05, 1.15, 1.25, 1.65, 1.85, 2.25, 2.5, 2.87, 3.21, 3.73, 4.85, 5.3, 5.51, 5.85]}, {"scene": "rest", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "The other eight were conflict cases, all but one without a gift.", "t0": 94.77, "t1": 97.55, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Penalties, the eight conflict cases", "rows": [["Frank Fung", "$24,200"], ["Gwyneth Borden", "$16,000"], ["Victor Makras", "$14,500 · $7,000 of it: a loan repaid"], ["Kathrin Moore", "$12,000"], ["Yakuh Askew", "$9,500"], ["Shamann Walton", "$4,500"], ["Luis Barahona", "$2,500"], ["Joanne Lee", "$250"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.08, 0.34, 0.53, 0.67, 1.03, 1.42, 1.6, 1.77, 2.01, 2.34, 2.44]}, {"scene": "rest", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["story[4]", "established[7]"], "text": "Frank Fung, Gwyneth Borden and Yakuh Askew did private business with or before the City.", "t0": 97.67, "t1": 103.63, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Penalties, the eight conflict cases", "rows": [["Frank Fung", "$24,200"], ["Gwyneth Borden", "$16,000"], ["Victor Makras", "$14,500 · $7,000 of it: a loan repaid"], ["Kathrin Moore", "$12,000"], ["Yakuh Askew", "$9,500"], ["Shamann Walton", "$4,500"], ["Luis Barahona", "$2,500"], ["Joanne Lee", "$250"]]}, "wt": [0.22, 0.55, 1.05, 1.48, 1.97, 2.3, 2.72, 3.28, 3.62, 3.94, 4.31, 4.64, 4.83, 5.19, 5.31]}, {"scene": "rest", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]", "established[10]"], "text": "Kathrin Moore voted on projects by the firm paying her pension.", "t0": 103.75, "t1": 106.94, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Penalties, the eight conflict cases", "rows": [["Frank Fung", "$24,200"], ["Gwyneth Borden", "$16,000"], ["Victor Makras", "$14,500 · $7,000 of it: a loan repaid"], ["Kathrin Moore", "$12,000"], ["Yakuh Askew", "$9,500"], ["Shamann Walton", "$4,500"], ["Luis Barahona", "$2,500"], ["Joanne Lee", "$250"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.65, 1.0, 1.17, 1.53, 1.68, 1.8, 2.12, 2.5, 2.66]}, {"scene": "rest", "kind": "rank", "ref": ["established[5]", "established[6]", "established[10]"], "text": "Victor Makras participated in three Mission Rock discussions and voted at a fourth meeting.", "t0": 107.06, "t1": 110.97, "shot": "b19", "visual": {"type": "rank", "label": "Penalties, the eight conflict cases", "rows": [["Frank Fung", "$24,200"], ["Gwyneth Borden", "$16,000"], ["Victor Makras", "$14,500 · $7,000 of it: a loan repaid"], ["Kathrin Moore", "$12,000"], ["Yakuh Askew", "$9,500"], ["Shamann Walton", "$4,500"], ["Luis Barahona", "$2,500"], ["Joanne Lee", "$250"]]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.23, 0.55, 1.11, 1.29, 1.55, 1.88, 2.09, 2.67, 2.83, 3.15, 3.27, 3.35, 3.61]}, {"scene": "rest", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[6]"], "text": "The commission assessed $7,000 for that participation and those votes.", "t0": 111.09, "t1": 114.81, "shot": "makras-order", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "makras-total", "kicker": "The six-count settlement", "text": "Three discussions and two votes", "mark": "two votes"}, "